.TH PUMP 1 "November 2026" "Data Pump 001_00" "User Commands"
.nh
.ad l
.nr HY 0
.ds AD l
.SH NAME
pump \- Data Pump command-line utilities
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B pump
.I command
.RI [ options ]
.br
.B pump
.BR \-\-help " | " \-\-version
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B pump
provides keyfile, audio-device and QR utilities, plus the Fast modem
subcommands. Fast modem behavior and options are documented in
.BR pump-fast (1).
.PP
The former single-carrier Robust audio commands have been removed. Robust
transmission and reception are unavailable in the GUI pending connection of the
canonical native backend. The staged Python receiver components are not an
end-to-end command-line service.
.SH COMMANDS
.TP
.B devices
List local audio device identifiers and descriptions, separated by tabs.
Accepts no command-specific options.
.TP
.B keygen
Create a new owner-only symmetric keyfile. The file must not already exist.
By default it contains one named entry, BDefaultR. Use
.BR \-\-key-names
for a comma-separated list of names. Key generation uses the selected audio
input when available; an unavailable or unusable device can produce a warning
if generation falls back to operating-system randomness.
.TP
.B keys
List named entries in the selected keyfile. Fast commands select one named key
with
.BR \-\-key\-name ;
by default, they use the first entry in the file.
.TP
.B qr
Encode plaintext as an SVG or PBM QR image. Supply text with
.BR \-\-text ,
read a file with
.BR \-\-input ,
or read standard input when neither is specified. Input path
.B -
also selects standard input. Output goes to standard output unless
.B \-\-output
names a new file.
.TP
.B fast-info
Print Fast modem profile information as JSON. See
.BR pump-fast (1).
.TP
.B fast-tx
Transmit one Fast text or file source. See
.BR pump-fast (1)
for required destination and options.
.TP
.B fast-rx
Receive a Fast WAV file. See
.BR pump-fast (1).
.TP
.B fast-listen
Receive a Fast live stream. See
.BR pump-fast (1).
.SH OPTIONS
Options use
.BR \-\-name=value
or separate
.BR \-\-name value
forms. Duplicate options and unknown options are errors. Global
.B \-\-help
and
.B \-\-version
are available.
.TP
.BI \-\-output " path"
For
.BR keygen ,
required destination keyfile. For
.BR qr ,
write the QR image to a new file instead of standard output. Existing files are
not overwritten.
.TP
.BI \-\-key-names " names"
For
.BR keygen ,
a comma-separated list of names. The default is
.BR Default .
Empty entries are rejected.
.TP
.BI \-\-device " id"
For
.BR keygen ,
select the audio input device used for entropy collection. The default device
is
.BR default .
.TP
.BI \-\-pad " path"
Use the optional pad associated with a keyfile for
.B keygen
or
.BR keys .
.TP
.BI \-\-keyfile " path"
For
.BR keys ,
select the keyfile to list. This option is required.
.TP
.BI \-\-text " text"
For
.BR qr ,
encode the provided plaintext. Choose either this option or
.BR \-\-input .
.TP
.BI \-\-input " path"
For
.BR qr ,
read plaintext from a file. Use
.B -
to read standard input. Choose either this option or
.BR \-\-text .
.TP
.BI \-\-format " svg|pbm"
For
.BR qr ,
select the output format. The default is
.BR svg .
.SH RETIRED COMMANDS
The commands
.BR tx ,
.BR rx ,
.BR listen ,
.BR simulate ,
.BR estimate ,
.BR analyze-link ,
.BR status-tx
and
.B status-rx
belonged to the retired single-carrier Robust modem and are unavailable.
They return a clear error; use the independent Fast subcommands where their
capabilities apply. This does not promise Fast wire compatibility.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR pump-fast (1),
.BR datapump-gui (1)
